{"url":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/earn-and-redeem","status":200,"title":"Earn and Redeem AlFursan Miles | Saudia","desc":"Earn and redeem AlFursan miles with Saudia flights and partners worldwide. Discover reward options and maximize your travel benefits. Start earning miles with Saudia today.","finalUrl":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/earn-and-redeem","bodyClass":"white-theme loyalty-offer baseLang mWebHomePage","h":3298,"sig":[{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-special-offers"],"h":1487,"headings":7,"imgs":0,"text":1177},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-faq"],"h":391,"headings":1,"imgs":0,"text":1290}],"h1":["Earn and Redeem AlFursan Miles | Saudia"],"html":"<sc-placeholder _ngcontent-saudiawebapp-c260489156=\"\" name=\"jss-main\"><!----><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper rewards-header\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Earn &amp; Redeem</h2><!----><p class=\"ng-star-inserted specialOffer-hd-para\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><p>AlFursan Miles Program</p>\n<p>Enjoy more from your membership with AlFursan Miles. You can earn and redeem both Reward and Tier Credits in the air on Saudia and SkyTeam flights, and earn Reward Miles on the ground by engaging in our fantastic partner offers, making it easier than ever to elevate your travel experience.<br>\n<br>\nAs you fly with Saudia and SkyTeam airlines, you will earn Tier Credits based on the distance traveled and the fare class of your ticket, helping you upgrade and enjoy more from your membership.<br>\n<br>\nEarn Reward Miles by flying, as well as on the ground every day, by using an AlFursan Credit Card, or engaging with our partners and their incredible offers. Reward Miles can be redeemed for a Reward Ticket and flight upgrades, helping you travel sooner, and in style.<br>\n<br>\nAnd if you're short on Reward Miles, don't worry – you can also buy Reward Miles to top up your account and reach your desired Reward faster. Enjoy more from your membership and start earning Miles today.</p></span><!----></p><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Miles Types</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><a class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Earn with Saudia</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><a class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Earn with AlFursan Partners</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><a class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Buy,Transfer &amp; Gift</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><!----><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\" href=\"/en-SA/loyalty-program/about-alfursan-program/alfursan-miles/buy-miles\" target=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Redeem Miles</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><!----><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\" href=\"/en-SA/loyalty-program/about-alfursan-program/alfursan-miles/miles-redemption\" target=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----></div></div><!----><!----><div role=\"link\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"offers-card card ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"offers-card-title\"><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Claim Missing Miles</h3><!----><span class=\"offer-label ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></div><div class=\"right-arrow\"><!----><a tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"offer-card-sm-arrow ng-star-inserted\" href=\"/en-SA/loyalty-program/about-alfursan-program/alfursan-miles/missing-miles\" target=\"\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined\">arrow_forward</span></a><!----></div></div><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-faq class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"faq-section rewards-faq ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.lt-lg=\"column\" fxlayoutgap=\"20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">Frequently asked questions</h2><!----><div class=\"all-faqs ng-star-inserted\"><a id=\"viewAllFaq\" class=\"faq_link_button ng-star-inserted\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.saudia.com/pages/help/faqs/alfursan-faq\n                  \" aria-label=\"'View all Frequently Asked Questions\"><span> View all FAQs </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined faq_icon icon-Link_chevron\"> chevron_right </span></a><!----></div><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-0 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to redeem your Miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-1\"> How to redeem your Miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-1 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-0 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-0\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-0\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-0\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Miles can be redeemed online. Sign into your AlFursan account and select 'Redeem Miles'. Alternatively you can redeem Rewards through the Saudia Guest Care Center.\n<br>\n</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to upgrade using your Miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-3\"> How to upgrade using your Miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-3 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-2 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-1\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-1\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-2\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Through <a href=\"https://www.saudia.com/\">www.saudia.com</a>, under 'manage', insert your booking reference and last name. Then log in with your frequent flyer program to be able to upgrade using your Miles.\n<br></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to add a family member to your account? \" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-5\"> How to add a family member to your account?  </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-5 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-4 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-2\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-2\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-4\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>To enroll family members, you have to be the head of the Family program and then follow the below steps:</p>\n<ol>\n    <li>Log into your profile</li>\n    <li>Choose the family program section</li>\n    <li>Click on \"manage my family program\"</li>\n    <li>Click on \"add member\"</li>\n    <li>You have two options (Adding a child or adding an adult)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>* Child: Has to be 2-12 years old.Fill the mandatory field(s) to enroll a new child on the program</p>\n<p>* Adult: Has to be an existing member of AlFursan.</p>\n<ol>\n    <li>Fill the mandatory fields</li>\n    <li>Click on the send button</li>\n    <li>The request will be reviewed by the Guest Call Center. If all the information is correct, they will submit an invitation to the invited member</li>\n    <li>The invited member will accept the invitation</li>\n</ol>\n<br>\n</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to claim missing Miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-7\"> How to claim missing Miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-7 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-6 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-3\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-3\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-6\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><ol>\n    <li>Log into your AlFursan profile</li>\n    <li>Choose the Miles claim section</li>\n    <li>Fill the mandatory fields</li>\n    <li>Submit the claim</li>\n</ol>\n<br></p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}